/-- Branchless major-groove reader synthesis operator `grooveSynthOp(d, b) ∈ ℤ_{aminoAcidClassesOp(d)}`
:
maps each target DNA base `b ∈ ℤ_{d_in(□)}` to its complementary amino-acid hydrogen-bond fork class:
- `b = 0 ↦ d` (`Ala`),
